    {
        "content": "<p><del>Hi, I think you can use <code>IsTree.card_edgeFinset</code>, and then get the  &lt;= version from the equality, so <code>(IsTree.card_edgeFinset ...).le</code> should suffice.</del></p>\n<p>Sorry, I misunderstood your question. I think the lemma can be slightly cleaner:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsAcyclic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">card_edgeFinset_le</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Fintype</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hG</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">G</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">IsAcyclic</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">card</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">G</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">edgeFinset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fintype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">card</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">obtain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₁</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hT</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Connected</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exists_isTree_le_of_le_of_isAcyclic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">connected_top</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OrderTop</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">le_top</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">G</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hG</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsTree</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">card_edgeFinset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hT</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_le_add_iff_right</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">card_le_card</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">edgeFinset_mono</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₁</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 600802339,
        "sender_full_name": "Justin Lai",
        "timestamp": 1780710127
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>FWIW your lemma is <code>IsAcyclic.card_edgeSet_add_one_le_card_vert</code> in <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/34910\">#34910</a> (roughly)</p>",
